#: ../../../algorithms/maxunc.md:26
msgid ""
"**Inputs** objective function $f$, search domain, initial sample count "
"$n_0$, evaluation budget $N$ **Output** evaluated archive (the set of "
"truly evaluated points and their function values)"
msgstr "**Inputs** 目的関数 $f$、探索範囲、初期サンプル数 $n_0$、評価予算 $N$ **Output** 評価済みアーカイブ（真に評価した点とその関数値の集合）"

#: ../../../algorithms/maxunc.md:29
msgid ""
"Sample an initial population of $n_0$ points, evaluate them with the true"
" function $f$, and add them to the archive"
msgstr "初期個体群を $n_0$ 点サンプリングし、真の関数 $f$ で評価してアーカイブに追加する"

#: ../../../algorithms/maxunc.md:30
msgid ""
"Fit a GP to the entire archive, obtaining the predictive standard "
"deviation $\\sigma(x)$ at any point (the predictive mean $\\mu(x)$ is not"
" used in computing the criterion)"
msgstr "アーカイブ全体にGPを当てはめ、任意の点における予測標準偏差 $\\sigma(x)$ を得る（予測平均 $\\mu(x)$ は基準の計算に用いない）"

#: ../../../algorithms/maxunc.md:31
msgid ""
"Find the point $x^* = \\arg\\max_x \\sigma(x)$ that maximizes the "
"predictive standard deviation"
msgstr "予測標準偏差を最大化する点 $x^* = \\arg\\max_x \\sigma(x)$ を求める"

#: ../../../algorithms/maxunc.md:32
msgid "Evaluate $x^*$ with the true function and add it to the archive"
msgstr "$x^*$ を真の関数で評価し、アーカイブに追加する"

#: ../../../algorithms/maxunc.md:33
msgid "Return to step 2 until the evaluation budget $N$ is reached"
msgstr "評価予算 $N$ に達するまで2へ戻る"

